{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every black phone present in the scene, there corresponds a specific arrangement of items: a camera is positioned directly above the phone and is situated on the left side of the image. A mouse is located to the left of the phone. Additionally, a knife is placed above the mouse, and a fork lies to the left of the knife.",
